              <div><b>05</b><span>Reading land laws from unverified social-media summaries.</span></div>
              <div><b>06</b><span>Collecting scheme names without knowing beneficiaries and objectives.</span></div>
              <div><b>07</b><span>Ignoring maps and district-level geography.</span></div>
              <div><b>08</b><span>Reading current affairs separately instead of updating static notes.</span></div>
              <div><b>09</b><span>Solving PYQs without mapping them to topics.</span></div>
              <div><b>10</b><span>Taking mocks without maintaining an error log.</span></div>
            </div>

            <h2>22. Final Paper 2 Checklist</h2>

            <div class="checklist">
              <div><b>01</b><span>Jharkhand history completed.</span></div>
              <div><b>02</b><span>Jharkhand Movement and state formation revised.</span></div>
              <div><b>03</b><span>Tribes, society and identity revised.</span></div>
              <div><b>04</b><span>Culture, literature, dance and music revised.</span></div>
              <div><b>05</b><span>Maps, rivers, minerals, forests and districts revised.</span></div>
              <div><b>06</b><span>CNT/SPT and other syllabus-listed laws reviewed from reliable sources.</span></div>
              <div><b>07</b><span>Economy, industries and policies revised.</span></div>
              <div><b>08</b><span>Major schemes and sub-schemes updated.</span></div>
              <div><b>09</b><span>Environment and disaster management revised.</span></div>
              <div><b>10</b><span>Jharkhand current affairs integrated.</span></div>
              <div><b>11</b><span>Previous-year questions analysed.</span></div>
              <div><b>12</b><span>Full-length tests attempted and analysed.</span></div>
            </div>

            <h2>23. The Winning Paper 2 Loop</h2>

            <div class="loop">
              <div><b>LEARN</b><span>Static Jharkhand topic.</span></div>
              <i>→</i>
              <div><b>MAP</b><span>Location/context.</span></div>
              <i>→</i>
              <div><b>PYQ</b><span>Actual JPSC question.</span></div>
              <i>→</i>
              <div><b>REVISE</b><span>Short fact card.</span></div>
              <i>→</i>
              <div><b>MOCK</b><span>Timed application.</span></div>
              <i>→</i>
              <div><b>REPAIR</b><span>Error notebook.</span></div>
            </div>

